**Output Note:** The table provides a detailed breakdown of how each individual stratum contributes to the final mean and variance.

Extracting the final sum values gives our overall estimates.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ybar <- sum(weighted_ybar_h)
var_ybar <- sum((1-nh/Nh)*pi_h^2*sh^2/nh)
seybar <- sqrt(var_ybar)
mem <- 1.96 * seybar

c(Est. = ybar, S.E. = seybar, ci.low = ybar - mem, ci.upp = ybar + mem) |> 
  format_str_gt()
```

